sequenceDiagram
    participant App as User Program
    participant DAG as DAGScheduler
    participant Task as TaskScheduler
    participant Exec as Executors
    participant Storage as HDFS/S3

    App->>App: Build transformation DAG
    Note over App: val result = df.filter(...).groupBy(...).agg(...)
    App->>DAG: Action triggered (count/collect/write)
    DAG->>DAG: Build stages
    Note over DAG: Narrow deps → same stage
    Note over DAG: Wide deps (shuffle) → new stage
    DAG->>Task: Submit TaskSet per stage
    Task->>Exec: Launch tasks
    Exec->>Storage: Read input partitions
    Exec->>Exec: Compute transformations
    Exec->>Exec: Cache/persist if needed
    Exec->>Task: Report task completion
    Task->>DAG: Stage complete
    DAG->>DAG: Schedule next stage
    Exec->>Exec: Shuffle intermediate data
    Exec->>Storage: Write output
    DAG->>App: Return result
